<title>ITALY: Italian funds post 3.408 trln lire Sept inflow.</title>
<headline>Italian funds post 3.408 trln lire Sept inflow.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian investment funds had a net inflow of 3.408 trillion lire in September, compared with a net inflow of 4.697 trillion lire in August, Assogestioni, the industry body said on Friday.</p>
<p>				    September 1996     August 1996</p>
<p> Redemptions (bln lire)	  4,467	     3,055</p>
<p> Subscriptions		     7,875	     7,752</p>
<p>Net inflow, outflow (-) from:</p>
<p> Equity funds			-532		  -52</p>
<p>     of which Italian	    -105		  -30</p>
<p> Bond funds			  4,213	     4,888</p>
<p> Mixed funds			 -273		  -139</p>
<p>-- Milan bureau +392 66129589</p>
</text>
